1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,945
Double the frequency, and the wavelength halves.

2
00:00:03,945 --> 00:00:06,901
Triple it, and the wavelength is a third.

3
00:00:06,901 --> 00:00:11,263
The product, f lambda, the speed, never changes.

4
00:00:11,263 --> 00:00:15,989
Changing the frequency of the source changes the wavelength, not the speed.

